  "notes": "Investment income over the limit publishes 1 only when the unsupported-situations answer is yes; no blocks. AGI at or above $68,675, and AGI at or above the 0-child completed amount, publish 1 with no EIC answer: Step 1 tests line 11b. A W-2 box 1 ceiling (worksheet line 1 at or above $68,675, or at or above the 0-child completed amount, while AGI is below that ceiling) publishes 1 only when that answer is yes, because a clergy or church-employee Schedule SE amount can put worksheet earned income below box 1; no blocks."
